WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.214 --> 00:00:03.797
(bluesy music)

00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:17.432
(birds calling)

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.746
(fabric flapping)

00:00:25.746 --> 00:00:29.531
(suspenseful music)

00:00:29.531 --> 00:00:31.563
(motor humming)

00:00:31.563 --> 00:00:34.313
(dramatic music)

00:00:37.446 --> 00:00:40.363
(glass shattering)

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:51.209
(glass shattering)

00:00:57.104 --> 00:01:01.017
(tires grinding on gravel)

00:01:01.017 --> 00:01:03.934
(glass shattering)

00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:09.478
(door slamming open)

00:01:09.478 --> 00:01:11.645
(gagging)

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.928
(shouting)

00:01:23.578 --> 00:01:24.411
Shit.

00:01:26.203 --> 00:01:29.620
(distant sirens blaring)

00:01:31.946 --> 00:01:32.779
Oh God.

00:01:33.766 --> 00:01:36.099
(muttering)

00:01:39.941 --> 00:01:40.941
Ah, ah sh...

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:46.443
(liquid dripping)

00:01:51.373 --> 00:01:52.367
(sniffing)

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:53.200
Hoo-ah.

00:02:03.113 --> 00:02:05.363
(coughing)

00:02:10.579 --> 00:02:11.412
(sirens nearing)

00:02:11.412 --> 00:02:12.245
Oh!

00:02:12.245 --> 00:02:13.320
Okay.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.373
Come on, come one, come on.

00:02:16.373 --> 00:02:19.123
(camera dinging)

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.620
My name is Walter Hartwell White.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.730
I live at 308 Negro Arroyo Lane,

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.260
Albuquerque, New Mexico 87104.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.610
To all law enforcement entities,

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:32.310
this is not an admission of guilt.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.283
I am speaking to my family now.

00:02:38.481 --> 00:02:40.648
(sobbing)

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:47.600
Skyler, you are the love of my life.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.740
I hope you know that.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:54.283
Walter Junior, you're my big man.

00:02:55.923 --> 00:02:57.280
There are...

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.970
There are going to be some things

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.270
that you'll come to learn about me

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.180
in the next few days.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.440
I just want you to know

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:10.930
that no matter how it may look

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:12.623
I only had you in my heart.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:20.513
Good-bye.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.533
(sirens approaching)

00:03:33.384 --> 00:03:36.467
(suspenseful music)

00:04:00.852 --> 00:04:03.685
(heavy breathing)

00:04:21.852 --> 00:04:24.435
(key clinking)

00:04:27.064 --> 00:04:28.052
(door slamming)

00:04:28.052 --> 00:04:31.073
(engine revving up)

00:04:31.073 --> 00:04:33.906
(tires squealing)

00:04:38.941 --> 00:04:41.691
(engine revving)

00:04:43.257 --> 00:04:46.518
(metal clinking)

00:04:46.518 --> 00:04:48.768
(laughing)

00:04:55.077 --> 00:04:57.327
(shouting)

00:05:09.094 --> 00:05:12.094
(labored breathing)

00:05:17.773 --> 00:05:20.023
(coughing)

00:05:31.868 --> 00:05:34.035
(tapping)

00:05:49.383 --> 00:05:52.133
(sirens blaring)

00:05:59.633 --> 00:06:02.633
(upbeat rock music)

00:06:08.146 --> 00:06:13.146
♪ Guess I got what I deserved ♪

00:06:15.348 --> 00:06:20.348
♪ Kept you waiting there
too long, my love ♪

00:06:22.958 --> 00:06:27.958
♪ All that time without a word ♪

00:06:30.683 --> 00:06:35.683
♪ Didn't know you'd
think that I'd forget ♪

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:42.070
♪ Or I'd regret ♪

00:06:42.096 --> 00:06:47.096
♪ The special love I had for you ♪

00:06:47.996 --> 00:06:52.996
♪ My baby blue ♪

00:06:57.322 --> 00:07:02.322
♪ All the days became so long ♪

00:07:05.042 --> 00:07:10.042
♪ Did you really think I'd do you wrong ♪

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:17.740
♪ Dixie when I let you go ♪

00:07:20.464 --> 00:07:25.464
♪ Thought you'd realize
that I would know ♪

00:07:26.963 --> 00:07:31.810
♪ I would show ♪

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:36.810
♪ The special love I have for you ♪

00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:40.375
♪ My baby blue ♪

